Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.00,0:02:34.46,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐懼嗎 再次睜開雙眼
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.08,0:02:40.00,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨嗎 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.46,0:02:53.06,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}知道自己沒有才能
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.06,0:02:55.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}但這能成為苟且偷生的藉口嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.57,0:02:58.03,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}在內心深處響起的悲鳴
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.03,0:03:00.14,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}究竟由誰來回應
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.14,0:03:04.04,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}至少在一生中有那麼幾次
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.98,0:03:08.78,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}想做個正直的當事者
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.63,0:03:12.19,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}倘若那就是今天？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.21,0:03:17.75,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}恐懼嗎 再次睜開雙眼
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.08,0:03:22.47,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}憎恨嗎 那局外人般的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.47,0:03:24.47,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}然而 你已經察覺到了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.47,0:03:26.10,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}身體已無法停滯不前
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.10,0:03:31.35,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「只因想起那不可失去的你」
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.35,0:03:34.97,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}「這點恐懼便不值一提」
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.18,0:03:36.73,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.38,0:03:39.26,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}不惜性命放聲高歌
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.19,0:03:41.58,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.59,0:03:44.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}此刻你便知曉
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.02,0:03:46.62,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}Lulalala
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.49,0:03:48.84,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}要在這裡結束嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.84,0:03:52.08,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur2}這絕非你所願吧
