Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.47,0:03:26.10,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}身體已無法停滯不前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:31.35,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}「只因想起那不可失去的你」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:34.97,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}「這點恐懼便不值一提」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:36.73,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}Lulalala
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:39.26,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}不惜性命放聲高歌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.19,0:03:41.58,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}Lulalala
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.59,0:03:44.33,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}此刻你便知曉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:46.62,OP_CN_EP02,,1200,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}Lulalala
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.49,0:03:48.84,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}要在這裡結束嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:52.08,OP_CN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,220)\blur10\3c&H4C6CF3&\bord1}這絕非你所願吧
Comment: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:47.14,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}テレスコープのぞいて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:49.49,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}見つめてる君
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:52.56,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そこにある日常は
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:54.57,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まるでさかさま
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:57.94,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}地に足がつかないわ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:00.35,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}こころうわの空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:03.36,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}行き場のない想いは
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:05.46,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}苦しくなるだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.74,0:22:12.62,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}ああ、辛いや
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.95,0:22:19.63,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}“もしも”なんて呪文
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.63,0:22:22.36,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なんの効力もないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:27.44,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部ぜーんぶ　わたしとならいいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.44,0:22:29.75,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って思ってしまうんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.75,0:22:32.53,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}好きだよ。好き？大好きだ。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.53,0:22:35.17,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}って言えていたのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.17,0:22:37.38,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}食べかけのフローズン
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.38,0:22:40.76,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}シャリシャリなメモリーズ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.19,0:22:42.22,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.59,0:22:43.57,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}足りない　足りない　足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.57,0:22:46.10,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}君成分が足りない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.63,0:22:47.60,ED_JP,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs40\blur3}We’re stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:48.29,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}触れたい　触れたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.29,0:22:51.53,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}冷たい愛凍えちゃう前に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:55.06,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}温めてよね　お願い
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:47.14,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}透過望遠鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:49.49,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}注視著的你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:52.56,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}眼前的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:54.57,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}彷彿顛倒一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.34,0:21:57.94,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雙腳無法踏實著地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:00.35,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}心思早已浮上雲端
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:03.36,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}無處安放的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:05.46,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}只會感到痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.74,0:22:12.62,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}啊 好難受
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.95,0:22:19.63,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}「假如」這類的咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.63,0:22:22.36,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}雖然沒有任何效果
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:27.44,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}全部全部 都能和我一起就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.44,0:22:29.75,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}還是忍不住會這樣想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.75,0:22:32.53,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}喜歡你。喜歡？超喜歡。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.53,0:22:35.17,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}明明能說得出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.17,0:22:37.38,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}吃到一半的冰沙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.38,0:22:40.76,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}留下沙沙作響的回憶
Comment: 0,0:22:40.19,0:22:42.22,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.59,0:22:43.57,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不夠 不夠 還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.57,0:22:46.10,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}你的成分還不夠
Comment: 0,0:22:45.63,0:22:47.60,ED_CN,,0,1200,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs35\blur3}We're stuck in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.90,0:22:48.29,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}想觸碰 想觸碰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.29,0:22:51.53,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在冰冷的愛凍結之前
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:55.06,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}請你將它溫暖起來
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
